<title>HONG KONG: Trading in CCT Telecom shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in CCT Telecom shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of CCT Telecom Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>CCT Telecom shares rose HK$0.04 to HK$0.52 on Friday.</p>
<p>Telecommunications equipment maker CCT Telecom Holdings was formerly China Treasure Telecom Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
